# Extra names the built image answers to, one per line — empty except during a rename.
#
# Callers take their model name from the environment stack (Terraform reads .model-version into
# AI__Private__Model) and the image deploys separately, so a rename cannot land on both sides at
# once. The image is built to answer to the old name too, deployed first, then the stack is
# applied; once every environment is on the new name, delete the line and rebuild.
#
# Ollama stores a tag lowercased and matches names case-insensitively, so a line may carry the
# historical spelling callers were given; the build checks it the way Ollama resolves it.
